OL,3,GNEWSANew junior Parkrun to launch in
OL,4,ADorking
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new junior Parkrun is being launched
OL,7,Fin a Surrey town.
OL,9,FThe weekly 2km (1.2 mile) run in
OL,10,FMeadowbank Park in Dorking will begin
OL,11,Fon 22 November.
OL,13,FIt is aimed at children aged four to 14
OL,14,Fand their families.
OL,16,FJames Thomas, junior Parkrun impact and
OL,17,Fengagement manager, said: "These runs
OL,18,Fprovide an opportunity for children to
OL,19,Fenjoy being active, build confidence
OL,20,Fand make friends."
